  "description": "Multi-provider email attachment extraction and management library for .NET with Gmail support. Extract, filter, and persist email attachments with pluggable storage backends, rich date filtering, and use-case oriented API. Provider-agnostic architecture ready for Outlook, IMAP, and custom providers.",
